{"id":"naac1ed4c51","headline":"‘No widespread issues’: On E20, govt faces question in Parliament, minister say this in reply","summary":"In a written reply to the Rajya Sabha, minister Suresh Gopi said the ethanol blending programme was implemented through a phased, scientifically validated process. He said there were no widespread issues.","why":"India's ethanol blending programme links fuel policy, sugar and grain markets, and automotive demand, making it a policy issue for the energy and agriculture sectors.","category":"economy","event_type":"regulation","importance":1,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"New Delhi","country":"India","lat":28.61,"lon":77.21,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"Hindustan Times","url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/india-news/no-widespread-issues-on-e20-govt-faces-question-in-parliament-minister-gopi-say-this-in-reply-101784546607053.html"},"sources":[{"name":"Hindustan Times","url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/india-news/no-widespread-issues-on-e20-govt-faces-question-in-parliament-minister-gopi-say-this-in-reply-101784546607053.html"}],"published_at":"2026-07-20T11:42:20Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T12:21:21Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"88c5fadbe783e892","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T12:21:21Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-07-20T11:42:20Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-07-20T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"IN","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/parliament-government-building-4873983.jpg","alt":"parliament government building (illustration)","credit":"marcelkessler","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/federal-buildin